      "content": "rebuilding sounds like a joke. how do you rebuild a life when the version of you that people liked is gone? i'm not the same person. i've been cast out, and once that happens, it's over. i just look at the future and it's just... nothing. it's just an empty room. it feels more logical to just stop existing than to keep trying to pretend i belong here.",
